#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "НАИМЕНОВАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "diff3 - compare three files line by line"
msgstr "diff3 — сравнить три файла построчно"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "ОБЗОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<diff3> [I<OPTION>]... I<MYFILE OLDFILE YOURFILE>"
msgstr "B<diff3> [I<ПАРАМЕТР>]... I<МОЙ_ФАЙЛ СТАРЫЙ_ФАЙЛ ВАШ_ФАЙЛ>"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "ОПИСАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Compare three files line by line."
msgstr "Сравнить три файла построчно."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Обязательные аргументы для длинных опций обязательны и для коротких опций."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-A>, B<--show-all>"
msgstr "B<-A>, B<--show-all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output all changes, bracketing conflicts"
msgstr "вывести все изменения, выделяя конфликтные"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-e>, B<--ed>"
msgstr "B<-e>, B<--ed>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output ed script incorporating changes from OLDFILE to YOURFILE into MYFILE"
msgstr ""
"вывести сценарий для ed, позволяющий внести в МОЙ_ФАЙЛ изменения между "
"СТАРЫЙ_ФАЙЛ и ВАШ_ФАЙЛ"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-E>, B<--show-overlap>"
msgstr "B<-E>, B<--show-overlap>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but bracket conflicts"
msgstr "то же, что и B<-e>, но выделять конфликты"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-3>, B<--easy-only>"
msgstr "B<-3>, B<--easy-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but incorporate only nonoverlapping changes"
msgstr "то же, что и B<-e>, но вносить только непересекающиеся изменения"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-x>, B<--overlap-only>"
msgstr "B<-x>, B<--overlap-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-e>, but incorporate only overlapping changes"
msgstr "то же, что и B<-e>, но вносить только пересекающиеся изменения"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-X>"
msgstr "B<-X>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-x>, but bracket conflicts"
msgstr "то же, что и B<-x>, но выделять конфликты"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-i>"
msgstr "B<-i>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "append 'w' and 'q' commands to ed scripts"
msgstr "дополнять сценарии для ed командами «w» и «q»"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-m>, B<--merge>"
msgstr "B<-m>, B<--merge>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output actual merged file, according to B<-A> if no other options are given"
msgstr ""
"вывести содержимое файла после фактического объединения; выполнять "
"объединение в соответствии с параметром B<-A>, если другие параметры не "
"указаны"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-a>, B<--text>"
msgstr "B<-a>, B<--text>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "treat all files as text"
msgstr "обрабатывать все файлы как текстовые"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--strip-trailing-cr>"
msgstr "B<--strip-trailing-cr>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "strip trailing carriage return on input"
msgstr "удалять из входных данных завершающие символы возврата каретки"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-T>, B<--initial-tab>"
msgstr "B<-T>, B<--initial-tab>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "make tabs line up by prepending a tab"
msgstr "выравнивать табуляцию, выводя символ табуляции в начале строки"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--diff-program>=I<PROGRAM>"
msgstr "B<--diff-program>=I<ПРОГРАММА>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use PROGRAM to compare files"
msgstr "использовать ПРОГРАММУ для сравнения файлов"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-L>, B<--label>=I<LABEL>"
msgstr "B<-L>, B<--label>=I<МЕТКА>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use LABEL instead of file name (can be repeated up to three times)"
msgstr ""
"использовать МЕТКУ вместо имени файла (параметр может быть указан до трёх "
"раз)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "отобразить эту справочную информацию и завершить работу"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-v>, B<--version>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "вывести информацию о версии и завершить работу"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The default output format is a somewhat human-readable representation of the "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Формат вывода по умолчанию представляет собой описание изменений, "
"относительно удобное для восприятия человеком."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<-e>, B<-E>, B<-x>, B<-X> (and corresponding long) options cause an ed "
"script to be output instead of the default."
msgstr ""
"Параметры B<-e>, B<-E>, B<-x>, B<-X> (и соответствующие им длинные "
"параметры) позволяют вывести сценарий для ed вместо вывода в формате по "
"умолчанию."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Finally, the B<-m> (B<--merge>) option causes diff3 to do the merge "
"internally and output the actual merged file.  For unusual input, this is "
"more robust than using ed."
msgstr ""
"Наконец, параметр B<-m> (B<--merge>) позволяет diff3 выполнить внутреннее "
"слияние и вывести содержимое файла после фактического объединения. Для "
"нестандартных входных данных этот метод является более надёжным, чем "
"использование ed."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If a FILE is '-', read standard input.  Exit status is 0 if successful, 1 if "
"conflicts, 2 if trouble."
msgstr ""
"Если ФАЙЛ задан как «-», читать из стандартного потока ввода. Код завершения "
"равен 0 в случае успеха, 1, если обнаружены конфликты, и 2, если произошла "
"ошибка."

#. type: SH
